      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ITSOKTOBEGREY (5) after racing outside the leader at the bell finished second as the $1.50 favourite last start over 2130m at Central Wheatbelt, beaten 3.5 metres, after scoring at the previous appearance over 1730m at this track when leading for most of the trip. Meets some better types this time but a win is not out of the question. ROCKABILITY (7) did not live up to market expectations last time out as the odds-on favourite when sixth, beaten 10 metres, over 2130m at this track but he had little luck in the running after racing wide early and then sitting outside the leader at the bell. Has to contend with a very wide draw but is a leading contender if things go his way. DAMAGE DONE (4) is worth another chance after a last-start ninth over 1177m at Pinjarra eight days ago after he raced outside the leader at the bell. AMERICAN TYPHOON (1) is worth some thought despite her last-start 11th over 1730m at this track on September 29 after she raced three-wide over the early running.",
